From c8c4e9e31bd85edc450cffa51628dda4d78b8af9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dogty <dogty@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 14 Jul 2026 12:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/9] lan: faster scans and joins, private commands,
 SetProtocol stub, on-demand nifm
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

前置移植(源码基线与 aylz10/ldn_mitm2 master 相同,可干净应用):
bsd-broadcast-relay 功能分支依赖的 LAN 发现/连接层改动。

- LAN discovery: faster scans and joins
- Return nn::ldn ConnectFailed (2203-0064) on join failure
- Implement ScanPrivate, CreateNetworkPrivate and ConnectPrivate
- Fix nifm request leak; refuse to connect to ourselves
- Drop our own echoed network from scans; fix station disconnect
- Stub SetProtocol (cmd 106)
- Acquire nifm only while needed (nifm_manager.cpp/hpp 新增)

Squashed from aylz10/ldn_mitm2 commits (author: dogty):
8ec4109 bf8784b cc57b02 274669e 8fad3f2 80a394d 0fe1b70

Ported-from: https://github.com/aylz10/ldn_mitm2/tree/beta/bsd-broadcast-relay-TONYX9000
